	(text "J6: pads only, FTDI cable pinout (TTL-232R-5V or adapter with 5 V on VCC).\nVCC powers the board (D8) and raises BOOT0 (R25). RTS resets through D9: NRST is not\n5 V tolerant. stm32flash -i / stm32loader drive RTS/DTR. SW1: BOOT0 by hand."
